    (d) Patents. Notwithstanding subsection (a), any rights granted
    under this Section with respect to Patents, together with any
    patent license granted under Section 3, shall be read and construed
    together as a single grant of rights under this License. Sections 2
    and 3 shall both apply to such rights and shall be interpreted
    consistently with one another, with the terms and conditions of
