The text should be enclosed in the comment syntax appropriate to the
file or media format. It is also recommended that a file or component
name and a brief description of purpose be included on the same
"printed page" as the notice, for easier identification within
third-party archives. Inclusion of the [URL] line is voluntary. If no
URL is available or you prefer not to include one, you may delete that
line, along with the word "at" that precedes it, before applying the
notice to your Work; doing so does not affect the validity or scope of
the License.

